    <releaseNotes>v1.10.0

- Executive: rename CRITICAL_PROCESS_EXCEPTION_DATA → SYSTEM_CRITICAL_PROCESS_EXCEPTION_INFORMATION,
  add SYSTEM_CODE_INTEGRITY_POLICY_HEADER, SYSTEM_CODE_INTEGRITY_POLICIES_FULL_INFORMATION
- MemoryManager: add MEMORY_BAD_INFORMATION_FLAG_* macros, doc comments
- ObjectManager: fix doc typo, add boundary descriptor docs
- Process: 39 enum comment improvements, 5 new types
- TransactionManager: 39 KTM function doc comments</releaseNotes>
